abstract: "An additive capability layer over the DeepSeek Harness: semantic memory, a capability-gated router, an LLM cache, accounting, coordination, a factory critic, a graded loop-guard ladder, a contract-pre-flight tool, a failure-signature memory, and a prompt-lume reducer, added with zero edits to existing packages."
